WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:11.690
HONG KONG

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.250
Hey! What's wrong?
Let's get going!

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.650
I thought I saw something!

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.040
Who would be here
at this time of night?

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.310
Come on. Let's go home and get drunk.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.370
Come out!

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:03.340
You don't show any
emotion when you see your lover?

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:06.980
You are so cold-blooded, Yui-Li.

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:10.410
Don't call me that!

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.750
That's useless.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:41.490
You can't do it.
You can't defeat me.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.910
Are you gonna run away?

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:57.900
You won't get away, I swear.
You shall die by my hands!

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:48.740
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:53.180
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:59.250
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:03.590
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:06.730
...in the human world.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:10.590
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:17.240
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:22.940
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:27.110
No one knows her true face.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:03.850
JAPAN

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.230
This is Japan.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:20.670
Somewhere in this country,
somewhere in this city, is that Shinma.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.820
I won't let him get away this time!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.510
What's that?

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:08.780
Rest in eternal happiness.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.230
- Who are you?
- Shinma!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:28.930
I don't like to be disturbed
while I'm eating.

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:39.040
Interesting.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:43.310
You are to blame! I get to
avenge the death of my family!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.060
Avenge?

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:03.510
Shinma, be prepared!

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.080
She's not the one!

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:15.990
Are you running away?

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:20.520
I don't have time to fight.
We'll pick this up later.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:28.430
Why were you easy on her, Miyu?

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.970
She didn't seem vicious to me.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:34.870
I don't think the Shinma hunt
was her only goal.

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:37.810
Do you want to find out
who she is?

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:41.410
Isn't it okay to care about
humans once in a while?

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:43.080
Seeing the match...

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:47.560
...it seems she mastered
Chinese Doh-shi martial arts.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.090
She seemed interesting.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.700
Here it is.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.890
Chang Doh-shi, are you in?

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:23.520
It's me, Yui-Li,
a student of Han Doh-shi.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.640
Did you say Yui-Li?

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:39.640
It's been a long time, Yui-Li.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.940
I apologize for my absence.

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:47.940
- Have you been well?
- Yes. You seem well too.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.950
- By the way, is that letter true?
- Letter?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:57.920
Yes. The letter telling me that
Shinma had appeared in Japan.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.920
Are you certain?

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:06.920
Sure, it's the demon we've been after.
There can be no mistake.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.300
I thought so too.
I'll get him this time.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:14.810
By the way, how is Han? Is he well?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:19.570
No. My mentor lost
in a fight with a Shinma.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:27.150
Is that so? Han...

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.480
Chang Doh-shi?

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.690
He was delicious.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:39.060
A doh-shi who's had extensive training
tastes especially good.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.260
Impossible!

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:46.460
This old man was just
as delicious as Han, Yui-Li.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:56.750
- I wonder how you taste.
- Shinma!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.460
You ate even him!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:14.870
I told you it would be difficult
for you to come to Japan.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.800
I don't remember that warning!

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:32.120
Now this is your final moment!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.420
You don't even shed tears.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.900
Your loved ones screamed and cried...

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:44.130
...right up until
the moment I ate them.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.540
My family!

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.010
You bastard!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.750
What are you?

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.560
A Shinma!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.160
It's her!

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:23.500
So, you're the one who's been
messing up my land.

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:27.710
So, even your sort exists
in this country.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:33.710
You narrowly escaped.
You're lucky, Yui-Li.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.420
Come back!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.610
He escaped again!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:45.260
That's no way to talk to me.
I saved you. A woman priest.

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.010
What is this?

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.810
Father. Mother.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:19.220
Mei-Fah! Everyone!
Where are you?!

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:21.790
Someone, answer me!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.300
Yang?

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:38.700
- Where is everyone?
- Everyone?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.240
They were all delicious!

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:51.820
That Shinma not only killed Yang...

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.690
...who was my lover...

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:57.420
...but also my family.

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:02.260
I will never forgive him.
I won't rest until I kill him.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.970
That won't be possible.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:10.040
You're not strong enough
to defeat that Shinma.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:15.490
No matter your skills as a doh-shi.
At least not for a human.

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:22.750
He's here now, and I don't like
a foreign Shinma coming here...

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:27.090
...and doing as he pleases.
Right, Larva?

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:32.770
But if I lend you my hand,
I would be in your way, right?

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:39.700
You want to defeat him
with your own hands, right?

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:43.440
I don't want any help from a Shinma.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.280
You shouldn't be stubborn like that.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:49.380
Is it my blood that you want?

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.550
Don't you want to know
eternal happiness?

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:57.520
A world without sorrow or suffering.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:03.220
I can let you have it,
in exchange for your blood.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:09.830
If I get to kill him, I won't care if
I get eternal happiness or hell.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:15.370
I would even sell my soul.
But I'm the one who kills him. Only me!

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:20.710
You are really arrogant.
I hate humans like you.

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:25.320
I hate you too!
You are just a Shinma, after all.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:37.590
Her intense emotion, that Shinma
will certainly take advantage of it.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.390
I know.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:51.180
So, hell's what you want.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.880
Where did you disappear to, Shinma?

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.150
Shisho Master, Chang Do-shi.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.800
What is it?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.920
This is...

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:26.080
If you are reading this note...

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:30.440
...the Shinma have killed me,
and I am no longer in this world.

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:34.150
But this needs to be said:

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:38.380
"The Shinma will depart
on the night of a new moon."

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.220
A new moon?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.390
A new moon! That's tonight!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.600
What a beautiful night.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:19.130
Farewell, Japan.
Farewell, foolish female doh-shi.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.270
Say farewell to this world too!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:28.000
Unbelievable! I really admire
your persistence.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:32.980
I'll never let you go.
I'll never forgive you.

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.610
I'll destroy you with my own hands!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:44.530
For Father, Mother,
Yang and Mei-Fah! Die!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.820
You're barking up the wrong tree
by calling me your foe.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:54.500
- It's too late for excuses!
- It's all your fault.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:59.000
- What?
- You were trying to stop us Shinmas...

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:03.640
...so we took revenge
on your loved ones.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:07.850
If you hadn't interfered,
no one would have died.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:12.880
- Shut up!
- They went to hell because of you.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:18.530
- Shut up!
- It's you who's going to hell.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:22.350
Shut up. Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.170
It can't be!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.770
Yui-Li, it's me, your father.

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:37.710
No! This is a Shinma!

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:47.740
- Please stop, Yui-Li.
- Mother.

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:52.020
Stop!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:00.330
- My sister?
- No.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:05.570
Why? Why didn't you save me?

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:10.370
I was so scared,
and it was so painful!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:16.580
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:20.560
I'm so sorry, Mei-Fah. I'm sorry.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:32.300
It's because of me
that you... that you...

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:35.330
Everyone was...

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:39.200
That's right, cry. Suffer!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:43.340
Your suffering is exactly
what keeps us alive.

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:47.990
Your suffering is our ecstasy!

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:54.090
And your soul is exactly
what we yearn for.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.460
You! Why?!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.070
I hate arrogant humans...

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:13.170
...but I hate Shinmas who eat
human sorrow even more.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:17.170
- You are...
- This isn't the time to discuss it.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:22.510
You bastard!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.590
Damn!

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:47.330
Shinma
KOH-WAKU

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.300
That's the real Shinma!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:53.410
He's been eating nothing
but human sorrow.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.650
No wonder he can't become strong.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:19:00.350
You bastards!
I'll destroy you!

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.060
Give up.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:59.200
I did it, finally.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.810
Everyone, you witnessed it.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:15.730
We made a deal.
Go ahead, you can suck my blood now.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:22.410
- Are you sure?
- I haven't left anything undone.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:27.130
I also want to have
what you call "eternal happiness."

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.780
So, please.

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:50.000
- Didn't I tell you?
- What?

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.300
That I didn't like you.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:59.300
So live your life,
with your pain and sorrow.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:33.370
Is it okay now
to cry as much as I want?

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:39.600
I'm sorry, Father, Mother, Yang.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:44.110
I'm sorry, Mei-Fah.

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:17.810
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.350
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:24.500
...from so far away?

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:27.320
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:31.590
Who are you?

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:38.260
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:43.100
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:47.580
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:52.050
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:56.250
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:56.460 --> 00:23:00.720
Washed away

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:07.530
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:11.980
Invited by the moon

00:23:12.170 --> 00:23:15.900
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:25.080
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:32.250
The sky cries for me

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:45.460
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:48.000
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:48.210 --> 00:23:52.140
...from so far away?

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:54.970
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:59.310
Who are you?

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:05.920
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:10.760
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:15.240
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:19.700
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:19.910 --> 00:24:23.900
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:24.110 --> 00:24:28.380
Washed away

00:24:31.090 --> 00:24:35.190
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:39.620
Invited by the moon

00:24:39.830 --> 00:24:43.560
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:46.200 --> 00:24:52.730
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:52.970 --> 00:24:59.970
The sky cries for me

00:25:04.350 --> 00:25:09.250
A man carrying a sin,
a decision made in darkness...

00:25:09.520 --> 00:25:13.390
...supporting each other,
trying urgently to follow a dream.

00:25:13.590 --> 00:25:16.320
They know they're no match.

00:25:16.530 --> 00:25:22.030
Still they'll go to the ocean
paradise. No one can save him.

00:25:22.340 --> 00:25:26.570
An event. Vampire Miyu.
The Moray Boat.

00:25:26.770 --> 00:25:30.610
Paradise is an ocean far away.
